      <figure class="reveal"><Image src={portrait} alt="Portrait of David Bennett" widths={[340, 680]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 300px, 340px" quality={72} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>David Bennett, Ph.D.</figcaption></figure></div>
    <p><b>I started as an engineer, became an MRI physicist, and never stopped teaching.</b> Today I help drug developers decide what an image should measure, and help students see what the equations mean.</p>
    </div>
    <h2 class="sr-only">What I offer</h2>
    <div class="cols3">
      <div class="reveal c-signal">
        <p class="mono">Full-time or consulting</p>
        <h3>Imaging endpoints that hold up to regulators</h3>
        <p>Biomarker and endpoint strategy for Phase 1 to 3 trials, central read charters, imaging CRO oversight and FDA briefing documents. I know the scanner from the coil up, so the science and the logistics agree.</p>
        <a class="go" href="mailto:dgbenn@gmail.com?subject=Role%20or%20project%20for%20David%20Bennett">Discuss a role or project</a>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal c-teal">
        <p class="mono">Teaching</p>
        <h3>Teaching that swaps memorizing for experimenting</h3>
        <p>College physics, a graduate MRI course I designed from scratch, high school robotics and board exam tutoring, now backed by simulators and AI tools I build myself.</p>
        <a class="go" href="mailto:dgbenn@gmail.com?subject=Teaching%20opportunity%20for%20David%20Bennett">Discuss a course</a>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal c-violet">
        <p class="mono">Talks and workshops</p>
        <h3>MRI explained so anyone can follow</h3>
        <p>Talks and workshops on MRI physics, imaging in drug development, and teaching with simulation and AI, shaped for your audience, from students to clinical teams.</p>
        <a class="go" href="mailto:dgbenn@gmail.com?subject=Talk%20invitation%20for%20David%20Bennett">Book a talk</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
